/* M028: Topology-count validation property failure; input: AP214 STEP file with MANIFOLD_SOLID_BREP (1 mm cube) where embedded topology-count GVP declares face_count=47 and edge_count=47; actual cube has 6 faces and 12 edges; receiver after auto-heal reports 6/12 — two slivers supposedly absorbed; structural information lost: face/edge count mismatch on import; kernel must report; archive-reject; synonyms: topology count validation fails, validation property fails check, face/edge count mismatch on import, structural information lost */
