/* Defect: topology-count GVP face_count=47, edge_count=47.
   Actual 1 mm cube: 6 faces, 12 edges, 8 vertices.
   Receiver after auto-heal gets 6/12 — two sliver faces absorbed.
   Count mismatch signals structural information was lost. */
